                                        "sense_id": "816b57e8-9d21-3d41-88d0-bd073a943f48",
                                        "entry_id": "86696fec-c2dc-337e-9172-16dda965c73d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fashionable person; a fop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7a22b9-7097-4f8b-afc1-94f26b2af624",
                                                "sense_id": "816b57e8-9d21-3d41-88d0-bd073a943f48",
                                                "text": "Just as I was stepping up to offer my hand to a very pleasing and witty fashionable, the brilliant and exclusive Mrs. Rawdon Crawley,\"—he wrote […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ff1f461-59d7-47e4-9217-01645258696a",
                                                "sense_id": "816b57e8-9d21-3d41-88d0-bd073a943f48",
                                                "text": "We speculated upon the astonishment that would have seized upon their simple, innocent hearts, had they beheld, instead of us, a bevy of our city fashionables in full bloom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61853242-0d18-46ea-aa17-1d6108268706",
                                                "sense_id": "816b57e8-9d21-3d41-88d0-bd073a943f48",
                                                "text": "In large measure the Metropolitan is a show-case for rich fashionables who are not trained in Wagnerian music and have no reverence for it, but who like to promote art and show their clothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14f0a589-9577-48e9-8b24-6812329dbe75",
                                                "sense_id": "816b57e8-9d21-3d41-88d0-bd073a943f48",
                                                "text": "A few, perhaps, have a further purpose; they desire to assist in that circus, to show themselves in the capacity of fashionables, to enchant the yokelry with their splendor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
